Installation procedure:

template: pip install <lib_name>
example : pip install pandas

If you want to install more than one library:

template: pip install <lib_nam> <lib_name>
example : pip install pandas matplotlib seaborn scikit-learn scipy

if you want to install with file.Then do the following

template: create a file with any name (requirement is what i prefer the name)
and start listing each library name one after the another in new line

then run the following commands

pip install -r requirements